<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>

<!--
	Demonstrates the declarative <switch> element: the detail pane (right) renders an
	input-dependent view of the selected Demo object. A high-priority object shows a <tab-bar>
	(Details + More), everything else a single detail form. Selecting rows of different priority
	re-evaluates the switch and swaps the view.
	
	The objects can be created (New), edited (the detail forms have an edit mode) and deleted, so the
	showcase is not restricted to looking at generated data. Editing the priority of the selected
	object swaps the view too, since the switch observes its input object - which also demonstrates
	that the commands of a hidden case do not stay behind in the panel toolbar. The criterion the
	switch tests is stated by the hint above the detail view and by the description of the priority
	attribute.
-->
<view>
	<channels>
		<channel name="model"/>
		<channel name="selectedDemo"/>
	</channels>
	<split-panel
		orientation="horizontal"
		resizable="true"
	>
		<panes>
			<pane
				min-size="220"
				size="35"
				unit="%"
			>
				<panel>
					<title>
						<en>Demo objects</en>
						<de>Demo-Objekte</de>
					</title>
					<commands>
						<generic-command
							image="css:bi bi-plus-lg"
							placement="TOOLBAR"
						>
							<label>
								<en>New</en>
								<de>Neu</de>
							</label>
							<execute-script function="x -> new(`demo.react:Demo`, transient: true)"/>
							<open-dialog
								bind-input-to="model"
								dialog-view="switch-demo-create.view.xml"
							>
								<bind
									channel="selection"
									to="selectedDemo"
								/>
							</open-dialog>
						</generic-command>
						<generic-command
							clique="more"
							image="css:bi bi-magic"
							placement="TOOLBAR"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Generate samples</en>
								<de>Beispiele erzeugen</de>
							</label>
							<with-transaction>
								<execute-script function="x -> count(6).foreach(i -> { o = new(`demo.react:Demo`, transient: false); $o.set(`demo.react:Demo#name`, 'Sample ' + ($i + 1)); $o.set(`demo.react:Demo#string`, 'Value ' + ($i + 1)); $o.set(`demo.react:Demo#active`, $i % 2 == 0); $o.set(`demo.react:Demo#amount`, ($i + 1) * 12.5); $o.set(`demo.react:Demo#date`, date(2026, ($i % 12) + 1, ($i % 28) + 1)); $o.set(`demo.react:Demo#priority`, if($i % 3 == 0, `demo.react:Priority#low`, if($i % 3 == 1, `demo.react:Priority#medium`, `demo.react:Priority#high`))); $o; })"/>
							</with-transaction>
						</generic-command>
						<generic-command
							clique="more"
							image="css:bi bi-trash"
							input="selectedDemo"
							placement="TOOLBAR"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Delete</en>
								<de>Löschen</de>
							</label>
							<executability>
								<null-input-disabled/>
							</executability>
							<with-transaction>
								<execute-script function="obj -> { if($obj != null, $obj.delete(), null); null; }"/>
							</with-transaction>
							<write-channel name="selectedDemo"/>
						</generic-command>
					</commands>
					<table
						observed-types="demo.react:Demo"
						selection="selectedDemo"
						types="demo.react:Demo"
					>
						<columns>
							<column attribute="name"/>
							<column attribute="priority"/>
						</columns>
						<rows>all(`demo.react:Demo`)</rows>
					</table>
				</panel>
			</pane>
			<pane
				size="65"
				unit="%"
			>
				<panel>
					<title>
						<en>Detail (input-dependent)</en>
						<de>Detail (eingabeabhängig)</de>
					</title>
					<inset>
						<text>
							<label>
								<en>Which view is shown depends on the priority of the selected object: "high" shows a tab view (Details + More), every other value a single form. Editing the priority swaps the view as well, without selecting another object.</en>
								<de>Welche Ansicht erscheint, richtet sich nach der Priorität des ausgewählten Objekts: „high“ zeigt eine Tab-Ansicht (Details + Mehr), jeder andere Wert ein einfaches Formular. Auch das Bearbeiten der Priorität wechselt die Ansicht, ohne dass ein anderes Objekt selektiert werden muss.</de>
							</label>
						</text>
					</inset>
					<switch input="selectedDemo">
						<case test="d -> $d != null &amp;&amp; $d.get(`demo.react:Demo#priority`) != null &amp;&amp; $d.get(`demo.react:Demo#priority`).get(`tl.model:TLNamedPart#name`) == 'high'">
							<tab-bar active-tab="details">
								<tab id="details"
									icon="css:bi bi-card-list"
								>
									<label>
										<en>Details</en>
										<de>Details</de>
									</label>
									<inset>
										<form
											input="selectedDemo"
											withEditMode="true"
										>
											<field attribute="name"/>
											<field attribute="string"/>
											<field attribute="priority"/>
											<field attribute="active"/>
										</form>
									</inset>
								</tab>
								<tab id="more"
									icon="css:bi bi-list-ul"
								>
									<label>
										<en>More</en>
										<de>Mehr</de>
									</label>
									<inset>
										<form
											input="selectedDemo"
											withEditMode="true"
										>
											<field attribute="count"/>
											<field attribute="amount"/>
											<field attribute="date"/>
											<field attribute="owner"/>
										</form>
									</inset>
								</tab>
							</tab-bar>
						</case>
						<default>
							<form
								input="selectedDemo"
								withEditMode="true"
							>
								<field attribute="name"/>
								<field attribute="string"/>
								<field attribute="priority"/>
								<field attribute="active"/>
							</form>
						</default>
					</switch>
				</panel>
			</pane>
		</panes>
	</split-panel>
</view>